  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate Smart Market Systems Development and Uganda Innovation Climate Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provide direct support to private firms in the agricultural sector. This will include affordable, fit-for-purpose, and widely accessible financial services, investment, and BDS that include climate smart support. And pilot sustainable land management solutions which could be commercialised through the Uganda Innovation Climate Fund.</narrative>
  </description>
